        "description": "User reviews: title, text, rating, reviewer name, date, helpful votes, device and app version, with total count and paging.\n\nEvery response includes `credits_used`: the credits this call cost.\n\nPrice: 1 credit per successful call. Docs: https://api.sh/docs/microsoft-store-reviews",
